WEBVTT

00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:03.060
Shoot, shoot, shoot!

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:06.650
If I don't earn some Life before I reach the field...!

00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:10.060
Geez, will you please stay calm!

00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:10.900
That's right!

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:15.610
I don't see any Magic or Trap Cards here that can recover your Life.

00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:18.330
Then all I can do is fight against someone!

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:22.150
Hey! Is anyone there?!

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:24.450
Like I said, just stay calm!

00:00:24.830 --> 00:00:26.610
Even if you tell me that...!

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:44.640
<i>Tron, ever since I saw you for the first time at the evening festival,</i>

00:00:45.010 --> 00:00:47.060
<i>I haven't been able to shake off the fear that's been eating away at me.</i>

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:51.780
<i>I'm positive this man can step on those things precious to us and crush them without hesitation.</i>

00:00:54.310 --> 00:00:55.110
<i>But I'll stop him.</i>

00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:58.860
Tron, I won't let you reach Kaito.

00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:03.200
Wow, you must really think highly of Kaito...

00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:05.260
I do.

00:01:07.610 --> 00:01:09.840
I love him.

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:13.260
That's quite beautiful.

00:01:14.680 --> 00:01:18.040
<i>Oh my… The ones who chose Jungle Field were…</i>

00:01:18.430 --> 00:01:22.230
<i>...the former Operation Committee member Droite and the mysterious boy Tron!</i>

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:26.190
<i>A Field Magic has been implanted in all four fields of the Finals,</i>

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:28.690
<i>which have given them distinctive characteristics!</i>

00:01:29.220 --> 00:01:31.530
<i>So, what will this Jungle Field offer-</i>

00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:33.940
<i>Wh-What happened here?!</i>

00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:37.610
- What the heck happened?!
 - In the middle of such an important moment, too!

00:01:37.610 --> 00:01:38.410
I can't see anything!

00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:41.410
<i>What an unthinkable mistake!
 I am most sorry!</i>

00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:44.120
<i>Please fix this as soon as possible, staff!</i>

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:51.090
<i>There's no way I can allow
 our guests to see this match, after all...</i>

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:56.910
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:01:57.200 --> 00:02:02.250
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:19.100
<i>Hey, my friends, what scenery do you suppose</i>

00:02:20.230 --> 00:02:24.900
<i>awaits us on the other side of this hill?</i>

00:02:25.690 --> 00:02:29.490
<i>Hey, my friends, let's climb it together</i>

00:02:30.860 --> 00:02:35.530
<i>It's too late for us to turn back now</i>

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:40.620
<i>The time has come to combine
 together the power dwelling inside me</i>

00:02:41.370 --> 00:02:46.170
<i>Gotta release my Soul Drive</i>

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:51.970
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:02:52.180 --> 00:02:57.010
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:02:57.560 --> 00:03:02.480
<i>Keep running, keep running, until you get there</i>

00:03:02.810 --> 00:03:08.150
<i>Once again, once again, keep those challenges coming</i>

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:14.320
<i>My friends, keep on living in the here and now</i>

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:20.410
<i>Keep pressing onward together no matter what happens</i>

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:25.390
Duel!!

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:29.310
8000 Life Points!

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:32.900
"Number 54: Tron vs Droite - Allure of the Death Butterfly!
 The Life-Threatening Jungle Field!"

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:30.810
You're a crafty one!

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:34.190
No matter what trick you use, I will defeat you.

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:36.650
Here in this Jungle Field.

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:43.450
If a player does not Summon, Special Summon, or set from their hand while

00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:47.870
this Field Magic is activated, they take 1000 points of damage.

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:52.710
I see. You came here knowing that.

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:58.170
So you're the one who set Traps on my Coaster route in order to lure me into this jungle!

00:03:58.460 --> 00:03:59.800
You really went to some great lengths.

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:04.970
The first turn belongs to me! My turn! Draw!

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:10.310
I activate the Magic Card,
 Phantasmal Dance of the Confusing Butterflies!

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:14.480
When I play this card when there is a Field Magic in play,

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:19.530
I can Special Summon the Level 4 or lower Phantom Butterfly Assassins, Morpho and Swallowtail!

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:24.070
Show yourselves, Phantom Butterfly Assassins Morpho, Swallowtail!

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:28.790
I Overlay the Level Four Morpho and Swallowtail!

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:33.830
I use these two Monsters to build the Overlay Network!

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:35.920
Xyz Summon!

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:40.090
Come forth, Photon Butterfly Assassin!

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:44.800
An Xyz right off the bat?!

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:50.140
Furthermore, I'll entertain you further with these three Continuous Magic Cards!

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:53.520
Up first is Butterfly Charm.

00:04:54.520 --> 00:05:01.360
Due to the Field Spell, this Jungle Field will deal great damage to the player who has not Summoned or set a Monster.

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:03.150
Right, I was listening before.

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:05.400
However, with Butterfly Charm,

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:11.080
if you Summon a Monster in Attack Mode that does not declare attack, it will be forcefully destroyed.

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:13.040
Then all I have to do is attack!

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:14.160
I won't let you do that.

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:16.460
The second, Assassin Gate.

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:23.340
When a Monster whose name does not contain “Assassin” attacks, it will be forcefully destroyed by this card.

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:25.840
Then my Monsters will...

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:31.560
Right. The only fate awaiting your Monsters is destruction, regardless of what you try to do.

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:33.220
N-No way!

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:34.350
I'm not done!

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:35.520
Huh?

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:38.600
The third, Death Butterfly's Invitation.

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:43.780
In order to maintain this card once activated, I need to pay 2000 of my Life.

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:53.790
But, when a Monster on the field is destroyed, it will inflict 1500 damage to the controlling player!

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:58.370
In other words, I will receive damage if I don’t Summon a Monster,

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:03.420
and even if I manage to Summon one, it will be destroyed, and I will receive critical damage in the process.

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:07.970
You use up 2000 of your Life in exchange for 1500 damage...

00:06:08.890 --> 00:06:12.430
I see! So that's why you raised your Life all the way up to 8000!

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:17.810
With this combo’s operation, you will be engulfed by this jungle within three turns!

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:20.650
<i>Kaito...</i>

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:24.150
<i>Ever since that day, I have always...</i>

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:33.780
<i>My fellow young Duelists,</i>

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:37.000
<i>It's painful... unbearable, isn't it?</i>

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:44.710
<i>But thanks to that pain, the next generation of elite Duelists shall be born!</i>

00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:47.840
<i>Trap, activate!</i>

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:53.180
<i>Draw!</i>

00:06:58.390 --> 00:06:59.310
<i>Th-That's...?!</i>

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:14.740
<i>Alright, the Ghost Lord is on a rampage!</i>

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:18.080
<i>If you wish to be rescued, you will need to win the Duel!</i>

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:27.710
<i>Droite!</i>

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:34.510
<i>No!</i>

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:39.480
<i>Kaito...</i>

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:41.230
<i>Draw!</i>

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:43.770
<i>I Summon Daybreaker!</i>

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:52.150
<i>Go! Direct Attack!</i>

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:16.760
<i>Don’t rely on others!</i>

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:21.060
<i>The moment you begin relying on others is the moment you lose sight of yourself.</i>

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:35.410
That's... Kaito...

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:39.580
<i>If I recall... that's Kaito's little brother...</i>

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:42.910
<i>Haruto, take a look. It's a butterfly.</i>

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:53.260
<i>That might of yours that refuses to rely on anyone...</i>

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:56.640
<i>It exists solely to protect your little brother.</i>

00:08:58.100 --> 00:08:59.930
<i>When I see your smile, I can't help but think that.</i>

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:04.350
<i>But even that smile... looks kind of sad.</i>

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:08.690
I've made up my mind.

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:13.030
Just as Kaito protects Haruto, I will protect Kaito.

00:09:13.740 --> 00:09:15.780
I won't rely on anyone else. I will fight on my own.

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:18.490
All so I can see Kaito's smile.

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:21.950
Then that means I must be a sacrifice for your love.

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:25.750
Ah man! It seems I'll be playing the buffoon!

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:31.210
Where are we?

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:35.760
The jungle...

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:37.430
That's...!

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:44.680
That's...

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:46.890
Droite!

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:49.480
Tron!

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:52.860
Droite...

00:09:58.570 --> 00:10:02.870
Yuma! Hey, look over here!

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:06.080
I got caught by a terrifying trap.

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:07.120
Trap?

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:11.960
The three Magic Cards on Droite's field?

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:13.670
Those are...

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:14.460
I see now.

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:18.720
It's a combo using those three Continuous Magic Cards and the Field Magic.

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:25.390
A strong one that forces the opponent to Summon a Monster, destroy it, then inflict damage to the player.

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:27.350
It's that powerful?

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:29.600
But there is a way to get around it.

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:31.310
That's right.

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:34.860
But I will triumph over love!

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:37.860
My turn! Draw!

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:41.740
<i>Due to the Jungle Field, I have to Summon a Monster.</i>

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:45.410
<i>If I Summon it in Attack Position, your combo will activate.</i>

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:47.710
<i>Thus, the correct response is…</i>

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:51.290
The correct response is to set a Monster in face-down Defense Position!

00:10:52.920 --> 00:10:55.750
Then I set one card and end my turn!

00:10:56.760 --> 00:11:00.680
So what now? Your combo won't activate if I set a Monster in Defense Mode, right?

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:02.300
It's useless to struggle.

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:06.720
You cannot escape me in this jungle.

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:09.690
My turn! Draw!

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:16.230
At this moment, in order to keep Death Butterfly's Invitation, I will pay 2000 of my Life!

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:21.780
I activate Photon Assassin Butterfly's effect!

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:29.000
By detaching one Overlay Unit, it can switch one Monster on the field from Defense Position to Attack Position!

00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:35.920
And that Monster's Attack Power will drop 600 points!

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:39.880
Heraldry Beast Aberconway was changed to Attack Position!

00:11:40.220 --> 00:11:43.590
Photon Assassin Butterfly, attack Aberconway!

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:45.430
Butterfly Death Dance!

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:02.320
And because of the Continuous Magic, Death Butterfly's Invitation,

00:12:02.610 --> 00:12:05.030
the destroyed Monster's controller...

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:09.290
...takes 1500 points of damage!

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:11.870
That's awesome, Droite!

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:15.250
I set a Monster in face-down Defense Mode.

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:17.920
Turn end.

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:22.340
A flawless, perfect combo, is it?

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:26.350
I won't let you meet Kaito.

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:27.760
Huh?

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:30.220
You're cutting away your own Life...

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:35.310
...no, cutting away your actual life in order to protect Kaito?

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:39.440
Are you thinking of Kaito to that extent?

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:44.240
All of your actions are what 
we refer to as the "power of love", right?

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:49.120
Huh? Love? Droite's doing this for Kaito?

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:54.000
Gosh, you're so thickheaded.

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:58.460
But the power of love, huh? It's kind of lovely...

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:02.170
Do you get it now? Even if you play a Monster in Defense Mode,

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:05.300
you will be unable to escape from this combo.

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:09.430
My turn. Draw.

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:14.940
I Summon Heraldry Beast Bernard's Falcon.

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:17.150
So you finally prepared yourself.

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:22.320
This moment you Summoned a Monster in Attack Mode,

00:13:22.650 --> 00:13:25.490
the effect of the Continuous Magic, Butterfly Charm, will activate!

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:30.160
All the Monsters on my opponent's field in Attack Mode must attack!

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:33.870
In addition, I activate the effect of the Continuous Magic, Assassin's Gate!

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:39.380
When Monsters attack that don't have "Assassin" in their name, they are forcefully destroyed!

00:13:43.460 --> 00:13:46.010
And because of the effect of Death Butterfly's Invitation...

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:52.140
...you take 1500 damage.

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:53.640
Awesome!

00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:57.310
That Tron dude may really not be able to beat Droite!

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:03.650
I did it! Now my victory is assure-

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:09.200
Nice. <i>Very</i> nice.

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:11.780
The "power of love" humans share.

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:13.990
I want to experience it as well.

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:17.540
I mean your painful emotions overflowing with memories of Kaito!

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:21.290
I want to sink my teeth into those memories.

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:24.920
Now, here I come!

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:28.680
I activate the Magic Card High Medallion Arts!

00:14:29.260 --> 00:14:34.850
This card allows me to conduct an Xyz Summon using two Heraldry Beasts with the same level from my Graveyard!

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:37.770
He's going to Xyz Summon with Monsters from the Graveyard!?

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:44.570
I Overlay the Level Four Aberconway and Bernard’s Falcon from my Graveyard!

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:48.400
I use these two Monsters to build the Overlay Network!

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:52.030
Xyz Summon!

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:55.580
Come forth, Number 8!

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:08.300
Heraldry King Genome Heriter!

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:13.680
That's...

00:15:14.300 --> 00:15:16.100
Tron's Number!

00:15:19.850 --> 00:15:22.480
I'll end my turn with this.

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:26.610
It makes no difference whether you played a Number! The next turn will determine the outcome!

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:29.280
My turn! Draw!

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:34.910
I won't let you lay even one finger on Kaito!

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:38.000
I activate the effect of Photon Butterfly Assassin!

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:40.540
I detach one Overlay Unit!

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:45.960
It switches a Defense Monster into Attack Mode and reduces its Attack Power by 600 points!

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:48.670
Excite Scales!

00:15:50.970 --> 00:15:54.970
Photon Butterfly Assassin attacks Heraldry King Genome Heriter!

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:56.310
This ends it!

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:58.520
Butterfly Death Dance!!

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:04.350
Yes! If this gets through...!

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:07.690
I activate Genome Heriter's effect!

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:12.820
By detaching one Overlay Unit, I can choose one of 3 effects!

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:17.580
I will steal your Monster’s name!

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:31.010
What's going on?

00:16:32.050 --> 00:16:34.760
I stole its name. Watch carefully.

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:41.350
My Genome Heriter’s name changes to Photon Butterfly Assassin.

00:16:43.310 --> 00:16:46.230
On the contrary, your Monster's lost its name.

00:16:47.190 --> 00:16:50.190
I wonder what will happen if it's no longer an "Assassin".

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:54.200
Th-This can't be...!

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:58.990
Now, I'll activate the effect of the Continuous Magic, Assassin Gate!

00:16:59.490 --> 00:17:02.960
When a Monster whose name does not contain "Assassin" attacks,

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:05.120
the attack is negated and it's destroyed!

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:07.460
Smash to pieces, Miss Nobody!

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:11.380
My combo's been broken...!

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:15.880
In addition, as per the effect of the Continuous Magic, Death Butterfly Invitation,

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:18.510
you'll take 1500 points of damage!

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:36.740
Does this mean I can't defeat that man?

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:43.370
Oh yeah, I just thought of something good.

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:50.170
I'll steal your memories from you.

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:54.670
No!!

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:59.390
It can't be... Droite's memories have...

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:01.180
Hey, Droite!

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:04.600
What's wrong?! Droite!

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:08.150
Don't let Tron's powers beat you!

00:18:09.770 --> 00:18:12.610
Weren't you fighting for Kaito's sake?!

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:17.070
You gotta win... and go see Kaito!

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:20.990
I... Kaito...

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:22.700
<i>Kaito!</i>

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:25.620
<i>Kaito...</i>

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:27.040
<i>Don't rely on others!</i>

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:35.880
That's right... I won't rely on anyone else!

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:39.510
I Summon Moonlit Papillion!

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:48.640
Then I Flip Summon the Phantom Butterfly Assassin Ulysses I had set in reverse!

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:59.280
I Overlay the Level Four Phantom Butterfly Assassin Ulysses and Moonlit Papillion!

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:03.030
I use these two Monsters to build the Overlay Network!

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:05.160
Xyz Summon!

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:09.410
Show yourself! Photon Alexandra Queen!

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:15.050
Droite... hasn't given up yet!

00:19:16.710 --> 00:19:19.130
I activate the effect of Photon Alexandra Queen!

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:24.930
I detach all of her Overlay Units to send every Monster on the field to our hands,

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:30.520
inflicting 500 points of damage to each player for each!

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:32.400
- A draw?!
 - A draw?!

00:19:33.230 --> 00:19:34.560
Butterfly Effect!

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:40.860
I don't need my Life... nor my real one at that!

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:44.530
Together with the memories I hold of Kaito, I will...!

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:46.870
Well said for an insect!

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:49.200
Your feelings, your memories...

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:51.290
...will become a delicious meal for me!

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:54.500
Trap, activate! Medallion Record!

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:58.710
It negates an effect that uses Overlay Units!

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:06.390
N-No way...!

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:11.810
Your turn?

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:15.560
Turn... end.

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:18.280
Droite! Stay with us!!

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:24.820
<i>No! I don't want to forget... you.</i>

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:26.740
They're flowing into me.

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:29.750
Your consciousness... Your memories... Your love!

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:33.710
My turn! Draw!

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:36.540
Sleep inside me, Droite.

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:41.720
I attack Photon Alexandra Queen with Photon Butterfly Assassin!

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:45.090
Stop it!!

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:47.390
Butterfly Death Dance!

00:20:54.730 --> 00:20:57.360
Because of the effect of Death Butterfly's Invitation...

00:20:57.940 --> 00:21:01.190
Droite, you will journey to the land of amnesia.

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:10.450
<i>Kaito...</i>

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:12.870
<i>Kai...</i>

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:25.550
What gives?

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:28.550
Memories of love aren't tasty <i>at all</i>.

00:21:29.430 --> 00:21:30.470
Tron!!

00:21:30.640 --> 00:21:33.810
Next time I'll eat <i>your</i> heart, Yuma.

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:37.440
Droite!

00:21:42.480 --> 00:21:44.490
Tell that person...

00:21:44.780 --> 00:21:48.450
Please... remember me...

00:21:56.580 --> 00:21:57.620
Kaito...

00:21:58.500 --> 00:21:59.330
No way...

00:21:59.630 --> 00:22:01.500
So that's... Tron's power!

00:22:03.130 --> 00:22:06.300
I won't ever... forgive you!

00:22:06.720 --> 00:22:08.470
Tron!!

00:22:10.470 --> 00:22:15.600
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:22:15.850 --> 00:22:21.230
<i>Move on ahead, speeding up our throbbing beats</i>

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:31.950
<i>Listen boys and girls, here's the secret to boys and girls like you</i>

00:22:32.330 --> 00:22:36.200
<i>You're really just so spontaneous, wild as can be</i>

00:22:36.200 --> 00:22:37.500
<i>I bet you didn't know?</i>

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:40.210
<i>You might be a handful, but what's wrong with that?</i>

00:22:40.330 --> 00:22:42.840
<i>Be up to no good, but learn for real</i>

00:22:42.960 --> 00:22:48.050
<i>Go the unpredictable route and shuffle your cards with a goal in mind</i>

00:22:48.220 --> 00:22:53.390
<i>Whenever you feel like you've lost your way, just take a minute to close your eyes...</i>

00:22:53.470 --> 00:22:59.020
<i>Shout "stop!" with all you've got, and there's your boundary line.</i>

00:23:00.350 --> 00:23:05.480
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:23:05.650 --> 00:23:10.990
<i>We won't just stop here, not when we don't want to have any regrets.</i>

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:16.240
<i>Even if we get hurt, we can't just hesitate now</i>

00:23:16.450 --> 00:23:21.830
<i>We won't just give up, not when our future's a lot brighter than our today</i>

00:23:21.830 --> 00:23:27.090
<i>Seriousness... It'll only make us keep fighting even harder</i>

00:23:27.300 --> 00:23:32.590
<i>We'll always get as fascinated as we want, and we'll fight on every day</i>

00:23:41.390 --> 00:23:46.650
The next battle takes place in the Space Field! The showdown between that Kaito and V will start!

00:23:46.940 --> 00:23:50.740
Plus, we learn the shocking truth from V.

00:23:50.740 --> 00:23:52.570
His attacks won't get through?!

00:23:52.570 --> 00:23:53.990
Yuma...! Over there!

00:23:53.990 --> 00:23:56.280
Kaito, V, and my dad?!

00:23:56.280 --> 00:23:59.330
Did all the mysteries start here?

00:23:59.540 --> 00:24:01.460
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal!

00:24:01.670 --> 00:24:05.420
"Galaxy Eyes Sealed?! The Cosmic Class Number Appears!"

00:24:05.960 --> 00:24:08.460
Is that...really a Monster?!

00:24:10.630 --> 00:24:14.470
This time we're gonna introduce Number 8, Heraldry King Genome Heriter!

00:24:14.470 --> 00:24:18.390
It's a terrifying Monster with the ability to absorb the name of the opposing Monster.

00:24:18.720 --> 00:24:19.520
Let's see...

00:24:19.520 --> 00:24:21.810
Whoa, did you forget my name?

00:24:22.230 --> 00:24:23.600
Wait, who are you again?
